WEBVTT

00:06.150 --> 00:07.610
Hang on a minute!

00:08.210 --> 00:10.690
That guy's not a true necromancer.

00:11.090 --> 00:12.220
Which means...

00:14.370 --> 00:16.420
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

00:26.180 --> 00:27.070
<b>THE</b>

00:27.070 --> 00:27.610
<b>LEGEN</b>

00:27.610 --> 00:28.110
<b>DARY</b>

00:28.110 --> 00:28.570
<b>HERO</b>

00:28.570 --> 00:29.070
<b>IS</b>

00:29.030 --> 00:29.530
<b>DEAD</b>

01:43.290 --> 01:45.960
<b>Episode 5</b>

01:43.290 --> 01:45.960
<b>The Legendary Hero Is Revived</b>

01:44.500 --> 01:45.960
<i>Curious.</i>

01:46.820 --> 01:48.630
<i>There are too many blood stains.</i>

01:50.400 --> 01:51.880
<i>It's not blood?</i>

01:51.880 --> 01:53.320
<i>They tricked me!</i>

01:54.140 --> 01:57.930
What's a guy boosted by soma drops gonna do?

01:57.930 --> 02:01.390
He's gonna send his skeletons out
 in all directions.

02:01.680 --> 02:05.850
We'll use the sacred sword to disguise ourselves
 as a rock and wait for our chance.

02:05.850 --> 02:07.190
Hang on a sec.

02:07.190 --> 02:11.730
He has to be feeling cautious.
Won't he keep some skeletons in reserve?

02:11.730 --> 02:12.770
Well...

02:12.770 --> 02:17.820
With remote necromancy, you share the 
perception of all the zombies you control.

02:17.820 --> 02:22.780
But it's impossible for a human 
to pay attention to that many at once.

02:22.780 --> 02:25.840
In other words, he'll easily
 fall for even a simple trap.

02:26.160 --> 02:28.370
What? What was that?

02:28.370 --> 02:31.580
Then, while he's concentrating
 on the skeletons,

02:31.930 --> 02:34.200
I'll infiltrate their ranks, and...

02:34.950 --> 02:37.420
<i>A skeleton accosting me of its own accord?</i>

02:39.770 --> 02:40.810
What?!

02:40.810 --> 02:42.870
I thought you might come.

02:42.870 --> 02:45.640
Unfortunately for you, 
that's a reinforced bracer.

02:45.640 --> 02:49.100
I moved the magic crystal over here.

02:49.100 --> 02:51.700
I knew that if you wanted to stop my magic,

02:51.700 --> 02:54.580
you'd target my crystal.

02:55.070 --> 02:58.960
Now, my skeletons! Tear him off of me!

02:58.960 --> 03:00.400
Ein Grendel!

03:02.410 --> 03:04.200
Even if we can't destroy these guys...

03:04.200 --> 03:06.140
We can still knock them away!

03:06.140 --> 03:08.330
They're using the spell in tandem?!

03:08.330 --> 03:11.790
Nevertheless, the instant my skeletons 
return, it's over for you!

03:11.790 --> 03:14.670
There's a chance our ambush may fail.

03:14.670 --> 03:19.020
If it does, I'll do whatever I can 
to expose his magic crystal.

03:19.020 --> 03:20.260
Then, Marguerite...

03:20.260 --> 03:22.640
You destroy it for me.

03:22.640 --> 03:24.890
Me? But...

03:24.890 --> 03:26.700
We're in a forest.

03:26.700 --> 03:30.180
There's tons of things around us
that we can use to make weapons.

03:30.460 --> 03:33.230
The wood of these trees
is extremely flexible.

03:33.550 --> 03:36.540
These are sturdy enough to make twine.

03:37.580 --> 03:39.210
See where I'm going with this?

03:43.050 --> 03:44.030
Isaac.

03:44.660 --> 03:46.240
Without you,

03:46.240 --> 03:50.570
I'd be in tears right now 
over my own powerlessness.

03:51.580 --> 03:53.040
Take a good look.

03:53.660 --> 03:56.350
Behold the person I've become
 under your tutelage.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.650
I know you can make the shot.

03:59.650 --> 04:00.670
Right.

04:00.980 --> 04:04.190
<i>This</i> is what a real princess looks like.

04:09.570 --> 04:11.310
No, no, no, no!

04:11.660 --> 04:13.210
What have you done?!

04:13.210 --> 04:14.240
Now...

04:14.770 --> 04:17.730
Are you ready for what's coming?

04:20.030 --> 04:22.860
The moment you set out to create
a thighless world,

04:22.860 --> 04:25.820
you were destined for defeat at my hands.

04:25.820 --> 04:28.600
Incredible! Was this all truly foretold?

04:28.600 --> 04:30.370
It absolutely was not.

04:30.370 --> 04:31.290
Touka!

04:31.640 --> 04:34.080
We're saved, aren't we?

04:34.080 --> 04:36.750
Yeah! Pretty much all thanks to me!

04:39.890 --> 04:43.510
Leland, what a nobody you turned out to be!

04:43.510 --> 04:46.720
And here I am, bringing you 
this nice souvenir...

04:46.720 --> 04:48.180
Siruela?!

04:49.530 --> 04:52.160
The devil with the red head 
I saw in the basement?!

04:52.640 --> 04:53.980
That's...

04:53.980 --> 04:55.730
a high-rank devil!

05:04.030 --> 05:05.490
Touka!

05:04.030 --> 05:05.500
Sir Touka!

05:05.500 --> 05:08.770
Aw, I missed the princess?

05:08.770 --> 05:10.840
Wait, is that the Sacred Sword?

05:10.840 --> 05:12.410
So that's the legendary hero?

05:12.410 --> 05:14.870
Well, whatever! Who's next?

05:15.420 --> 05:16.670
<i>I think this was...</i>

05:16.670 --> 05:18.400
Ein Rosabis!

05:18.400 --> 05:20.000
Ein Grendel!

05:20.590 --> 05:23.420
<i>I don't know if I stand 
a chance against this thing,</i>

05:23.420 --> 05:24.550
<i>but I have to try!</i>

05:27.840 --> 05:30.800
Decent moves for a nobody.

05:30.800 --> 05:32.020
How's Touka?!

05:32.020 --> 05:33.280
He's alive!

05:33.280 --> 05:35.400
But given his poor regenerative abilities...

05:35.400 --> 05:36.640
Find any soma drops?!

05:36.640 --> 05:37.540
None!

05:37.540 --> 05:38.850
That was the last of them!

05:38.850 --> 05:41.350
Anri, send him back to his body!

05:41.350 --> 05:43.190
We at least have to save his soul!

05:44.070 --> 05:44.900
No!

05:44.900 --> 05:49.110
If I send him back in this state, 
he'll degenerate for sure!

05:51.220 --> 05:53.160
So you're Anri?

05:53.470 --> 05:57.740
You're the necromancer 
Leland kept talking about...

05:57.740 --> 05:59.250
So what's all this?

05:59.250 --> 06:02.920
We don't feel grief 
when someone dies, do we?

06:02.920 --> 06:05.230
You know, necromancers like us.

06:05.880 --> 06:07.110
"Like us"?

06:07.470 --> 06:09.430
I'll take you along.

06:11.290 --> 06:14.930
Now, let's get back to the killing!

06:14.930 --> 06:18.980
I wonder how king will react 
when he sees his dead daughter!

06:18.980 --> 06:20.480
Ein Seil!

06:21.500 --> 06:24.380
Your Highness, I'll buy you time!

06:24.380 --> 06:25.190
Use it!

06:27.900 --> 06:30.530
Ah, the little rat who refuses to die?

06:32.250 --> 06:33.850
I'm here too!

06:33.850 --> 06:35.990
Pathetic nobodies!

06:41.430 --> 06:42.580
<i>It's no use.</i>

06:42.580 --> 06:45.170
<i>I can't pee when I'm nervous!</i>

06:45.170 --> 06:47.630
It's okay. Forget it.

06:47.630 --> 06:50.400
That's not something a princess 
should be doing anyway.

06:50.400 --> 06:51.640
Touka!

06:51.640 --> 06:54.490
I figured this was how things would shake out.

06:54.490 --> 06:59.640
Some farmer like me 
trying to save the world...?

06:59.640 --> 07:01.230
Don't say that!

07:01.230 --> 07:05.600
You were willing to sacrifice 
your life to protect me!

07:05.600 --> 07:09.820
You're a true hero to me, at the very least!

07:09.820 --> 07:11.400
Yeah?

07:11.870 --> 07:14.650
Then can your hero ask a final wish?

07:15.250 --> 07:17.500
I've got stockings in my pocket.

07:17.500 --> 07:20.240
If you'd put them on, 
just this one last time...

07:20.240 --> 07:22.150
You're still thinking about that now?

07:28.270 --> 07:29.320
Touka?

07:32.100 --> 07:33.260
Touka?!

07:33.800 --> 07:37.430
I refuse to allow you to die here!

07:37.890 --> 07:38.970
I refuse...

07:45.850 --> 07:49.690
You must take responsibility.

07:50.530 --> 07:53.030
Because through all your lies...

07:54.450 --> 07:57.580
Through your lies, I fell in love!

08:02.370 --> 08:06.040
What's the matter? 
You're looking pretty slow.

08:07.420 --> 08:10.010
<i>I've used so much mana that I'm feeling faint...</i>

08:10.010 --> 08:13.720
You can relax now! You bought us enough time.

08:14.840 --> 08:18.000
Brought back to life by a princess's tears...

08:18.000 --> 08:20.840
Doesn't get more "legendary hero" than that.

08:21.640 --> 08:24.520
So you <i>are</i> the legendary hero.

08:24.520 --> 08:27.360
No, wait... Is there someone else in there?

08:28.280 --> 08:30.320
Still, no matter how many times you revive,

08:30.320 --> 08:32.740
you'll still be a nobody!

08:36.460 --> 08:38.650
Who're you calling a nobody?

08:39.910 --> 08:42.330
You're the nobody here!

08:44.310 --> 08:45.680
A giant...

08:45.680 --> 08:47.330
thigh?!

08:47.710 --> 08:49.170
Get crushed,

08:49.170 --> 08:51.150
you eyebally bastard!

08:55.390 --> 08:57.720
So that's the legendary hero?

08:57.720 --> 09:00.790
Wonderful. How touching.

09:00.790 --> 09:05.650
Our revenge story wouldn't be exciting 
if he wasn't at least that strong.

09:06.060 --> 09:07.430
What happened?

09:07.430 --> 09:10.440
Things could get rather interesting soon.

09:10.440 --> 09:14.570
<b>Diego Valentine
"Bloody Tears Diego" the Necromancer</b>

09:10.440 --> 09:14.900
You should look forward to it, Mr. Snot-Nose!

09:14.900 --> 09:17.600
I really wish you'd stop calling me that.

09:14.900 --> 09:18.530
<b>Friedrich Norstein
 "Mr. Snot-Nose" the Necromancer</b>

09:20.190 --> 09:23.320
What happened to Leland 
after he was arrested?

09:23.570 --> 09:27.080
Dr. Leland overdosed on soma drops, so...

09:27.080 --> 09:30.070
Bones! Bones! Bones! Bones!

09:30.070 --> 09:32.300
He went nuts, huh?

09:32.300 --> 09:36.500
Siruela was badly injured. 
She'll be hospitalized for some time.

09:36.500 --> 09:40.510
After facing a devil like that,
it's a wonder she's even alive.

09:40.510 --> 09:43.520
Yeah, she's pretty amazing.

09:44.060 --> 09:46.100
What's going to happen to the orphanage?

09:46.100 --> 09:48.220
No need to worry there.

09:48.220 --> 09:51.050
I've thrown my hat into the ring to be director.

09:51.050 --> 09:52.660
You wanna take over?

09:52.660 --> 09:54.120
In name only at first.

09:54.120 --> 09:56.170
I plan to relearn my principles of education

09:56.170 --> 09:59.240
so that I never make the same mistake again!

09:59.240 --> 10:01.960
You make me sound like 
a failed experiment...

10:01.960 --> 10:03.980
But my MES is cured.

10:03.980 --> 10:05.590
What?! It is?

10:05.590 --> 10:06.460
Yes!

10:06.870 --> 10:09.420
Maybe crying ten years of pent-up tears

10:09.420 --> 10:13.380
and getting my real 
feelings out did the trick.

10:13.380 --> 10:16.380
I was hoping for your help
 if I ever rot again...

10:16.380 --> 10:18.940
Her condition's not 
for your convenience, you know!

10:18.940 --> 10:20.440
R-Really, don't worry!

10:20.440 --> 10:23.390
I'll give you my remaining soma drops.

10:23.390 --> 10:24.350
You mean it?

10:24.660 --> 10:28.060
So I can finally start my 
journey as a proper hero!

10:28.060 --> 10:30.930
Our true battle begins now!

10:30.930 --> 10:33.400
Don't say that. You'll jinx it.

10:33.400 --> 10:38.210
By the way, what did you mean 
about "getting out your real feelings"?

10:38.210 --> 10:40.110
Oh, well...

10:40.110 --> 10:42.760
<i>I said it in the heat of the moment...</i>

10:42.760 --> 10:45.200
<i>I'm much too embarrassed to say it again!</i>

10:45.200 --> 10:48.940
I do remember making a dying wish...

10:50.620 --> 10:52.810
W-Will this do?

10:53.740 --> 10:56.070
Lusciousness on par with Yuna's!

10:56.070 --> 10:59.450
Like a radish so plump 
that you can barely pluck it!

10:59.450 --> 11:01.550
<i>A radish? A fellow vegetable!</i>

11:01.550 --> 11:03.760
I'd hate to say goodbye.

11:03.760 --> 11:07.070
I could worship those thighs every day...

11:07.070 --> 11:09.270
That's the creepiest pick-up line
I've ever heard.

11:09.270 --> 11:10.740
I'm very sorry.

11:11.830 --> 11:14.520
I am still a princess, you see...

11:16.240 --> 11:18.360
You're setting out again?

11:18.360 --> 11:20.200
The world's in danger, after all...

11:20.200 --> 11:21.340
I see.

11:21.340 --> 11:24.570
Then allow me to bestow you
with a token of my esteem.

11:24.570 --> 11:26.760
I hope it'll be of use to you.

11:27.510 --> 11:28.830
What's this thing?

11:28.830 --> 11:30.670
An enchanted carriage.

11:30.670 --> 11:34.420
It moves by infusing the magic crystal 
in the driver's seat with mana.

11:35.660 --> 11:37.250
It moves with mana?!

11:37.250 --> 11:40.090
<i>So I'll be doing all the driving?!</i>

11:37.250 --> 11:40.090
<b><i>Shock</i></b>

11:37.250 --> 11:40.090
<b>Mana Level 2</b>

11:37.250 --> 11:40.090
<b>Mana Level 1</b>

11:40.620 --> 11:43.840
Marguerite's not gonna see us off?

11:44.800 --> 11:49.530
Her Highness is having her lessons 
with another tutor over there.

11:49.530 --> 11:51.100
Oh, you're right.

11:52.020 --> 11:54.810
She asked me to deliver this letter.

11:55.920 --> 11:58.240
<i>Touka, Yuna, Anri...</i>

11:58.700 --> 12:04.050
<i>If not for you, I might be 
lost to the world right now.</i>

12:04.050 --> 12:07.280
<i>The gratitude I feel for you 
cannot be expressed in words.</i>

12:07.780 --> 12:11.940
<i>Touka, when I learned that you 
were not the real legendary hero,</i>

12:11.940 --> 12:14.260
<i>I was deeply hurt.</i>

12:14.260 --> 12:18.460
<i>But I will forever treasure 
the memories I made with you.</i>

12:18.460 --> 12:21.310
<i>And once peace returns to the world,</i>

12:21.310 --> 12:25.430
<i>I hope to meet you in your true form.</i>

12:25.430 --> 12:29.840
"PS—I packed a present for you 
in the trunk in the back."

12:30.340 --> 12:31.390
A present?!

12:35.310 --> 12:36.750
Marguerite!

12:36.750 --> 12:39.320
You need to take responsibility
for your lies!

12:40.110 --> 12:45.590
I'll be giving you the training you need 
to become a true legendary hero!

12:45.590 --> 12:47.940
Aw, shucks! No way!

12:50.210 --> 12:52.660
<i>I've planned this all out perfectly!</i>

12:52.660 --> 12:56.300
You don't think the princess 
stashed herself in there, do you?

12:56.660 --> 12:59.320
And the one who waved 
to us was a body double?

12:59.320 --> 13:00.340
Don't be stupid!

13:00.340 --> 13:03.220
She'd never trick us like that!

13:03.220 --> 13:07.740
Don't you dare besmirch
the woman who saved your life!

13:07.740 --> 13:08.620
<i>No way...</i>

13:08.620 --> 13:10.930
Sorry. I didn't mean it like that.

13:11.180 --> 13:13.910
<i>They'll be so disappointed if they find me...</i>

13:15.270 --> 13:20.940
<b>Days later, they discovered her
on the verge of starvation.</b>

13:21.820 --> 13:24.860
<b>Fifteen Days Out from the Capital</b>

13:24.860 --> 13:26.320
Take that!

13:27.410 --> 13:29.300
You left yourself wide open.

13:29.300 --> 13:32.350
C-Can we give the training a rest?

13:32.350 --> 13:33.750
I don't need it.

13:33.750 --> 13:37.480
I can just enlarge the Sacred Sword 
and smash any enemy we run into.

13:37.480 --> 13:40.820
But you're back down
to a mana level of 3 now.

13:40.820 --> 13:41.960
Huh? Already?

13:41.960 --> 13:46.970
You're expending mana every day 
to repair your body.

13:46.970 --> 13:48.950
It's impressive maintenance, considering.

13:48.950 --> 13:52.020
How many vials of soma drops 
did you bring, Marguerite?

13:52.020 --> 13:53.060
Five.

13:53.060 --> 13:54.510
<i>This is bad!</i>

13:54.510 --> 13:57.520
<i>We gotta get to the Gates of Hell 
and finish this journey fast!</i>

13:57.520 --> 13:58.680
Don't get the wrong idea.

13:58.680 --> 14:01.940
It's dangerous to rely entirely
on soma drops.

14:01.940 --> 14:03.920
You need to learn how to fight without mana!

14:03.920 --> 14:07.140
If it comes down to it,
a good pitfall solves most problems.

14:07.140 --> 14:10.490
I won't allow you to fight 
in such an unheroic way!

14:10.490 --> 14:13.920
Touka is incapable of learning 
anything he's not interested in.

14:13.920 --> 14:16.650
He never learned to raise 
anything that wasn't a radish.

14:16.650 --> 14:19.660
Because it's the perfect food! 
 Great to look at, great to eat!

14:19.660 --> 14:21.670
In life, a radish is all you need!

14:22.170 --> 14:25.090
Speaking of needing,
is it really okay for you to be with us?

14:25.090 --> 14:26.880
Can the capital get along without you?

14:26.880 --> 14:29.780
I'm sure Isaac will cover for me.

14:30.200 --> 14:36.310
And I believe it's best that I use 
everything he taught me to save the world.

14:36.680 --> 14:39.210
Choosing to fight on 
the front lines yourself...

14:39.210 --> 14:42.020
The brave princess takes after her father.

14:42.020 --> 14:45.200
The fate of the world rests
on your shoulders.

14:45.200 --> 14:47.170
And yours too, right?

14:47.170 --> 14:48.860
Sir Touka!

14:48.860 --> 14:50.950
We'll have fowl for dinner tonight!

14:50.950 --> 14:51.820
Great work!

14:51.820 --> 14:53.160
It looks delicious!

14:53.160 --> 14:54.670
W-Wait!

14:54.670 --> 14:56.730
That's a letter from Siruela!

14:57.650 --> 15:01.030
<i>The moment you slew 
that high-rank devil the other day,</i>

15:01.030 --> 15:06.090
<i>one of the court magicians spotted 
an astral form flying to the northeast.</i>

15:06.090 --> 15:09.890
<i>We believe the devil was being 
controlled via possession necromancy</i>

15:09.890 --> 15:14.840
<i>by someone other than Leland.
Perhaps a true necromancer.</i>

15:15.230 --> 15:18.210
<i>It would be dangerous to leave them at large.</i>

15:18.210 --> 15:22.100
<i>I'd like you to head northeast 
and track down the necromancer.</i>

15:22.390 --> 15:24.480
Know anything about this, Anri?

15:24.480 --> 15:27.410
I don't know who was possessing that devil,

15:27.410 --> 15:30.380
but if another necromancer 
managed to survive,

15:30.380 --> 15:34.570
there's a very good chance they want revenge
for what happened three years ago.

15:34.570 --> 15:36.610
I see.

15:37.040 --> 15:38.320
"Dear Siruela..."

15:38.320 --> 15:40.490
"Run your own investigations."

15:40.490 --> 15:41.890
And done!

15:41.890 --> 15:43.950
"And done," my butt!

15:43.950 --> 15:45.720
I'm the legendary hero.

15:45.720 --> 15:48.340
Sealing the Gates of Hell comes first.

15:48.340 --> 15:51.930
I'm tired of fighting nudists 
and weirdos with bone fetishes.

15:52.260 --> 15:55.640
I wanna do some real legendary hero stuff!

15:57.740 --> 15:59.310
Well, fair enough.

16:00.230 --> 16:02.480
<b>Moaran</b>

16:01.010 --> 16:02.480
Hang on a minute.

16:02.480 --> 16:04.020
What's all this?

16:04.020 --> 16:07.340
It's important that you 
learn proper dinner etiquette.

16:07.340 --> 16:09.480
Everyone's staring at me.

16:09.480 --> 16:12.970
I need you to be a respectable 
legendary hero, Touka.

16:12.970 --> 16:13.700
How come?

16:13.700 --> 16:17.700
Because I h-have to marry you!

16:17.700 --> 16:21.660
When our journey's over, I won't be the hero.
I'll be back in my original body—

16:20.440 --> 16:24.820
Once you save the world,
you <i>will</i> be a legendary hero!

16:24.820 --> 16:28.170
I was kinda planning on going 
back to my old life.

16:28.170 --> 16:29.340
Indeed!

16:29.340 --> 16:31.800
Sir Touka means to live the
slow life with me!

16:31.800 --> 16:32.880
Absolutely not!

16:32.880 --> 16:35.260
Surely you don't intend to defy the king!

16:35.720 --> 16:37.540
<i>Hey, what's going on here?</i>

16:37.540 --> 16:39.870
<i>Are beautiful girls fighting over me?!</i>

16:39.870 --> 16:42.710
<i>And over </i>me<i>, not Sion?!</i>

16:42.710 --> 16:44.650
<i>Well, golly gee!</i>

16:46.660 --> 16:47.970
Hang on a minute.

16:47.970 --> 16:50.430
How'd this become a tug-of-war 
with the townspeople involved?!

16:50.430 --> 16:52.440
You're tearing me apart! Really!

16:55.720 --> 16:57.180
Your Highness...

16:57.180 --> 17:00.230
Do you really wanna marry Touka?

17:00.230 --> 17:03.400
W-Well, that <i>is</i> my royal duty...

17:03.400 --> 17:04.830
Are you out of your mind?

17:05.130 --> 17:08.740
Touka is kind. He always smiles at me.

17:08.740 --> 17:11.440
He saved my life as well.

17:12.580 --> 17:14.760
He saved your life...

17:14.760 --> 17:19.530
I'd be more than happy
to fulfill my duty with Touka.

17:19.970 --> 17:24.090
Might I inquire as to your own 
feelings about Touka, Yuna?

17:24.570 --> 17:27.060
I mostly can't ditch the guy, 
no matter how hard I try.

17:27.060 --> 17:31.530
But after he collapsed,
you went after that devil immediately.

17:31.530 --> 17:34.440
Surely you wouldn't do that
over a man you felt nothing for...

17:34.440 --> 17:38.030
Well, I kinda think of him 
as a bratty little brother.

17:38.030 --> 17:42.820
Then you would have no objection 
to my marrying Touka?

17:45.230 --> 17:48.120
Wh-Why are you even asking me about this?

17:48.120 --> 17:50.310
Why should I care what you do?

17:51.420 --> 17:54.930
<i>Surely you wouldn't do that
over a man you felt nothing for...</i>

17:55.380 --> 17:57.840
<i>It's really not like that.</i>

18:05.600 --> 18:07.720
Hang on! I'm just here
to get something I left—

18:07.720 --> 18:08.990
<i>These</i>, perhaps?!

18:08.990 --> 18:10.230
My stockings!

18:10.230 --> 18:13.570
Listen, they're all the rage
in hero's parties these days!

18:13.570 --> 18:16.650
Stop using the hero's body 
to do the strangest things!

18:16.650 --> 18:18.310
You're getting on my nerves!

18:18.310 --> 18:19.930
Going on about the hero again...

18:19.930 --> 18:21.780
When are you gonna let that guy go?

18:21.780 --> 18:24.320
He saved my life! I'll never let him go!

18:24.320 --> 18:27.120
Meanwhile, you're never 
around when I need you!

18:27.120 --> 18:28.500
Just like three years ago!

18:28.500 --> 18:32.340
You weren't there when I was in real trouble!

18:32.340 --> 18:36.050
We're together all the time,
but you don't care what happens to me?

18:36.800 --> 18:38.240
Hey! Yuna!

18:39.280 --> 18:41.260
Don't you wanna put on clothes?

18:41.260 --> 18:44.400
Why is he so obsessed with me?

18:44.400 --> 18:45.510
It's so stupid!

18:46.870 --> 18:51.100
Now that the princess has joined us, 
they don't need me anyway.

18:52.370 --> 18:54.400
If you don't wanna go home,

18:54.400 --> 18:56.360
this can be your room.

18:56.780 --> 18:58.530
And this one'll be mine.

18:59.990 --> 19:03.450
I'll stay with you forever, Touka!

19:04.770 --> 19:07.030
Even if I go back now...

19:08.660 --> 19:10.790
Wh-What? Perverts!

19:10.790 --> 19:12.130
But I'm dressed like a perv too...

19:13.590 --> 19:15.040
What the hell are you doing?!

19:15.500 --> 19:17.460
Th-There are so many perverts!

19:19.780 --> 19:22.110
<i>It makes sense given how I'm dressed,</i>

19:22.110 --> 19:24.680
<i>but that's still an awful lot of pervs...</i>

19:25.390 --> 19:27.100
<i>My head hurts.</i>

19:27.100 --> 19:30.940
<i>And where I got bit is on fire.</i>

19:31.350 --> 19:34.740
<i>These townspeople... 
They're not just perverts.</i>

19:34.740 --> 19:36.770
Yuna! You okay?!

19:36.770 --> 19:38.540
Touka! What are you doing?

19:38.540 --> 19:41.630
What do you think? 
You ran out in your underwear!

19:41.630 --> 19:43.250
Or is that your style now?

19:43.250 --> 19:44.660
Hell no!

19:46.530 --> 19:48.490
Yuna, what's wrong?

19:48.490 --> 19:51.650
I feel... hot all over...

19:51.650 --> 19:53.960
Really? When you're in your underwear?

19:53.960 --> 19:56.840
<i>Is she coming on to me?</i>

19:56.840 --> 20:01.030
<i>Stripping down to her undies, making me 
chase her into some abandoned alleyway...</i>

20:01.380 --> 20:02.930
<i>Yeah, it's gotta be!</i>

20:03.640 --> 20:06.850
<i>Time to go all the way with Yuna!</i>

20:08.450 --> 20:09.270
<i>Huh?</i>

20:09.770 --> 20:12.350
<i>Wait... I'm in the hero's body.</i>

20:12.720 --> 20:15.570
<i>So if we do, it'll actually 
be the hero doing it!</i>

20:15.570 --> 20:18.700
<i>Even dead, he's still getting in the way!</i>

20:18.700 --> 20:21.640
<i>Sion the Legendary Hero, you sleazy bastard!</i>

20:22.680 --> 20:26.030
Damn it! The townsfolk 
are a bunch of peeping toms!

20:26.900 --> 20:28.400
Touka...

20:28.400 --> 20:31.580
They aren't just normal townsfolk...

20:33.540 --> 20:35.500
Seriously, Yuna, what's wrong?

20:36.330 --> 20:38.710
They bit me.

20:38.710 --> 20:40.300
They bit you?

20:41.150 --> 20:43.180
It doesn't look that bad.

20:45.370 --> 20:47.320
<i>Wait, am I...</i>

20:48.410 --> 20:50.990
Touka, revert the Sacred Sword.

20:50.990 --> 20:52.150
If I do that—

20:52.150 --> 20:53.020
Just do it!

20:58.380 --> 21:00.240
Hey, what are you doing?!

21:00.930 --> 21:03.280
I'm sorry, Touka.

21:04.860 --> 21:09.290
I think I'm turning into one of them.

21:09.290 --> 21:11.160
So you have to run.

21:11.160 --> 21:13.120
Like hell I'm leaving you behind!

21:13.120 --> 21:14.280
Just do it!

21:14.280 --> 21:17.810
I was planning to leave you anyway.

21:17.810 --> 21:19.590
You were? Why?!

21:19.590 --> 21:21.920
Because I don't want to be around you!

21:21.920 --> 21:24.880
Because I don't like you anymore!

21:24.880 --> 21:27.840
So get the hell away this instant!

21:27.840 --> 21:29.050
In your dreams!

21:30.010 --> 21:34.140
I don't care if you're a monster
or if you don't like me!

21:34.140 --> 21:37.600
None of that's any excuse
to leave you behind!

21:37.850 --> 21:41.260
<i>Why? When I'm trying so hard 
to drive him away...</i>

21:41.570 --> 21:43.040
Damn it...

21:43.610 --> 21:45.400
Need a hand?

21:45.870 --> 21:49.240
I'll do it if you'll admit 
you're not the real hero.

21:49.240 --> 21:52.620
I dunno who you are,
but I admit it! So help me!

21:52.620 --> 21:54.270
Very well.

21:54.270 --> 21:56.430
Now burn the sight into your mind...

21:56.430 --> 22:00.210
of the glorious polearm-wielding 
 Twin-Spear Belarco!

22:04.440 --> 22:06.180
Wh-What's wrong?

22:08.430 --> 22:09.970
I sprained it.

22:10.010 --> 22:21.110
<b>Next Time</b>

22:11.010 --> 22:21.110
<b>The Legendary Hero Is a Girl</b>
